    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Energy good; weight steady</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing change; chews well</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Regular bowels; no bleeding or heartburn</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Up once at night; good stream; no leakage</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Knee ache on the hill, 2 of 10</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No skin changes under the gel</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dizziness or numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 0</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
