  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-2">
    <td>Primary osteoarthritis of both knees, diagnosed clinically by the ACR criteria (knee pain, age over 50, morning stiffness under 30 minutes, crepitus, bony enlargement, no warmth), with reduced quadriceps strength and balance and an increased risk of falls; KOOS JR 62</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
